[00:02.498]MASKS
{"面具"}
[00:04.321]项目策划|总制片：姬海棠羽笠果
[00:05.804]导演：像素山海（宇言DX）
[00:06.610]作曲/编曲：AzureHead
[00:07.961]作词：Yoshi
[00:09.043]调校：瑞安Ryan不跑调
[00:09.916]演唱：Rose
[00:10.656]混音：圈太Studio
[00:11.451]吉他：Sepia
[00:26.846]Let me wander and bring you to a new world
{"让我漫游并带你前往新世界"}
[00:29.142]Being a wind sweeping over the land
{"化作席卷大地的风"}
[00:32.351]I may pretend to steal the moonlight
{"或许我会假装偷走月光"}
[00:34.815]In darkness who can tell right from wrong, nor you from I
{"黑暗中谁能辨明对错 亦或你与我"}
[00:38.059]When I put a mask on, following my heart
{"当我戴上面具 随心而行"}
[00:40.938]Being the King or a clown,it's just matter of my mind
{"成为国王或小丑 不过一念之间"}
[00:43.696]When I put a mask on, no one in my eyesight
{"当我戴上面具 目中再无他人"}
[00:46.470]Hollow men come and go, leaving nothing but a hole
{"空心人来来往往 只留下空洞"}
[00:49.135]
[00:49.497]wo～ o～
[00:50.936]Welcome to the big show
{"欢迎来到盛大演出"}
[00:52.259]wo～ o～
[00:53.477]I sing for the free soul
{"我为自由灵魂而歌唱"}
[00:55.147]wo～ o～
[00:56.434]As an artist from the street
{"作为街头艺术家"}
[00:58.031]I know, I know, my life is a show
{"我明白 我明白 我的人生即是一场秀"}
[01:00.368]
[01:00.796]Floating in ocean or mind, walking and dreaming
{"漂浮在海洋或思绪中 行走且梦想"}
[01:03.590]This is the lifestyle I used to immerse in
{"这是我曾沉浸的生活方式"}
[01:06.475]Talking to a bird or a wood, laughing and weeping
{"与飞鸟或树木对话 又哭又笑"}
[01:09.043]The whole world has been falling for a century
{"整个世界已沉沦了一个世纪"}
[01:11.758]
[01:12.123]wo～ o～
[01:13.395]I'm looking for my fun
{"我在寻找我的乐趣"}
[01:14.908]wo～ o～
[01:16.326]So I put a mask on
{"于是我戴上面具"}
[01:17.732]wo～ o～
[01:19.067]I start it, moving on
{"我启程前行"}
[01:20.515]wo～ o～
[01:21.835]revolving up and down
{"旋转上升又坠落"}
[01:23.450]Even going back to ground
{"甚至重回地面"}
[01:24.849]Please put your mask on
{"请戴好你的面具"}
[01:26.194]
[01:37.119]Believing in a lie and taking all the worries away from your mind
{"相信谎言　将所有忧虑从脑海驱散"}
[01:42.937]And then you may find me at the fork of the roads
{"或许你会在道路分岔处遇见我"}
[01:45.357]It‘s the time to say goodbye, to party in the night
{"是时候告别　在夜晚狂欢"}
[01:49.342]
[01:49.874]Lalala...
[02:07.086]
[02:07.596]When you put a mask on, following your heart
{"当你戴上面具　追随内心"}
[02:10.527]Being the smart or a fool, it's just matter of your mind
{"成为智者或愚人　只在你一念之间"}
[02:13.433]When you put a mask on, the gamble had begun
{"当你戴上面具　赌局便已开始"}
[02:16.100]No worries since you’ve enjoyed the fun
{"既已享受乐趣　何必担忧"}
